    "rich-text-0": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>Knowing what's in your supplements shouldn't require a leap of faith. At Orenda, we think you deserve better than that, so we built a quality process that doesn't stop until we're certain.<\/em><\/p><p><em>Every Orenda product is manufactured in GMP-compliant facilities right here in the United States. Good Manufacturing Practices aren't a minimum standard we meet; they're the foundation on which everything else is built. Our facilities comply fully with the FDA's stringent standards for dietary and nutritional supplement manufacturing, with multiple quality checkpoints at every stage from raw materials to finished product. Every ingredient is tested for identity, purity, and potency before it ever becomes part of what you're taking.<\/em><\/p><p><em>But we don't stop there.<\/em><\/p><p><em>Beyond the analytical and certificate-of-analysis testing already conducted by our suppliers and manufacturers, every finished Orenda product is sent to an independent, third-party laboratory for confirmation — one that is FDA-certified and ISO\/IEC 17025-accredited. We do this because our manufacturers' word, good as it is, isn't enough for us. We verify.<\/em><\/p><p><em>When the science points to a patented ingredient as the right choice for a specific product, because the research is stronger, the bioavailability is better, or the results are more consistent, that's what we use. Those decisions are made carefully, in consultation with our formulators and the health professionals who work alongside us and use these products themselves. Patented ingredients represent independent investment in development, testing, and validation that generic alternatives don't always carry. We don't choose them lightly. We choose them when they're genuinely a better option, and when that choice can be reflected in a product that remains accessible to the people who need it.<\/em><\/p><p><em>The vendors and ingredient suppliers we work with are held to the same standard. Every one of them is registered, licensed, and certified by outside agencies that independently verify their compliance with industry guidelines, government regulations, and quality assurance practices. We don't do business with vendors who can't meet that bar.<\/em><\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text"
      ],
