    "0f374230-3b4b-4fb2-be91-37e4aba998e5": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "03a4c3ad-f533-4db3-8281-96386dc8e164": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>Our ingredients are sourced from around the world, selected for quality and efficacy above all else. In all cases where the highest quality ingredients are available in certified form, that's what we use. Our ingredient sources are predominantly non-GMO, and we're actively working to close that gap to 100%. You'll find the non-GMO designation on product labels where it applies, and we'll keep updating those labels as we get there.<\/em><\/p><p><em>Our formulas are developed based on established ingredient research using premium, active ingredients. We'd rather point you to the science directly than ask you to take our word for it. <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov\/\"><em>PubMed<\/em><\/a><em> is the most reliable resource we know for the latest research on supplement ingredients, and we're confident in what you'll find there about what goes into Orenda products.<\/em><\/p><p><em>You should know exactly what you're putting in your body. We built our entire quality process around making sure you can.<\/em><\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
